title: Payers › Arrive on the page
route: /payers
intro: How a person lands on Payers: the landing page (/payers) lists every payer, and a payer's address (/payers/:id) opens its workspace with four views. The older tab names still work in links. Payers are the same for every viewer and site view; only the drafts an update can redraft follow the site. Every other Payers diagram starts from one of the hand offs at the bottom.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Payers' in the sidebar\nunder Connections"
start s2 "Open a link to one payer\nBell notification, FLO answer, Demo menu,\nEligibility 'Rules' link, an address"
process p1 "Address is /payers\nNo payer"
process p2 "Address is /payers/cardinal?tab=changes\nor ?tab=builder, rules, test, history,\nor the older process, documents, changes"
decision d1 "Does the address name a payer?"
decision d2 "Is it a known payer?"
screen nf "'That payer is not in the demo'\nButton 'Back to all payers'"
click cnf "Click 'Back to all payers'"
screen land "Payers landing page\n'N payers. The agents know how each one works.'\nSearch, three filters, 'Add a payer', one row per payer"
decision d3 "Which view does ?tab name?"
process t1 "builder, process, missing or unknown\nOpens Workflow Builder"
process t2 "rules\nOpens Rules & Instructions"
process t3 "documents\nOpens Rules & Instructions with the\nClinical documentation group open and in view"
process t4 "test\nOpens Test Workflow"
process t5 "history, changes\nOpens History & Changes"
screen ws "Payer workspace\nBreadcrumb 'Payers › name'\nHeader, then four tabs"

group gB "What the badges count"
  process b1 "Sidebar 'Payers' badge\nPayers with a change waiting\n3 at the start: Cardinal, Evergreen and Harborview.\nFalls when a change is applied. Same for every viewer and site"
  process b2 "'History & Changes' tab badge\nThe waiting change plus each Historian suggestion\nFalls as each is handled"
endgroup

goto g_land "Continues in: Payers › Landing › Search, filter and open a payer"
goto g_add "Continues in: Payers › Add a payer"
goto g_head "Continues in: Payers › Workspace › What the header says"
goto g_bld "Continues in: Payers › Workflow Builder › Read a workflow"
goto g_rules "Continues in: Payers › Rules & Instructions › Read the rules"
goto g_test "Continues in: Payers › Test Workflow › Run a test case"
goto g_hist "Continues in: Payers › History & Changes › Read what changed"
goto g_site "Continues in: Payers › Sites › Clinic-wide payers, drafts in view"

s1 --> p1 --> d1
s2 --> p2 --> d1
d1 -->|No| land
d1 -->|Yes| d2
d2 -->|No| nf --> cnf --> land
d2 -->|Yes| d3
d3 --> t1 & t2 & t3 & t4 & t5
t1 & t2 & t3 & t4 & t5 --> ws
land --> g_land
land -.-> g_add
ws --> g_head
ws -->|Workflow Builder| g_bld
ws -->|Rules & Instructions| g_rules
ws -->|Test Workflow| g_test
ws -->|History & Changes| g_hist
land -.-> b1
ws -.-> b2
ws -.-> g_site
